{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14403","headline":"感怀二首 一 · 戴叔伦","name":"感怀二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尺帛无长裁，浅水无长流。\n水浅易成枯，帛短谁人收。\n人生取舍间，趋竞固非优。\n旧交迹虽疎，中心自云稠。\n新交意虽密，中道生怨尤。\n踟蹰复踟蹰，世路今悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}